{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2021-12-07 18:43:00', 'title': 'EPAM SYSTEMS SET TO JOIN S&P 500', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EPAM SYSTEMS INC. (NYSE:EPAM) WILL REPLACE KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN (NYSE: KSU) IN THE S&P 500 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON TUESDAY, DECEMBER 14. CANADIAN PACIFIC RAILWAY LIMITED (NYSE AND TSX: CP) IS ACQUIRING KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN IN A TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON OR ABOUT THAT DATE PENDING FINAL APPROVALS.'}{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2021-12-07 10:02:00', 'title': 'EPAM AND MARS WIN 2021 ACQUIA ENGAGE AWARD', 'text': 'NEWTOWN, PA., DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), A LEADING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION SERVICES AND PRODUCT ENGINEERING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WAS SELECTED ALONG WITH MARS, INCORPORATED, AS THE WINNER OF THE 2021 ACQUIA ENGAGE AWARD FOR "LEADER OF THE PACK: RETAIL.'}